{"id":1202,"level":68,"name":"Вигідні взяття","group":"Практика","format":27,"description":"<p>Sometimes you can capture a loose piece in more than one way. Or there might be two or three capturing options. Watch out! Make sure you do no take the wrong piece. And be careful not to use the wrong piece for capturing. A bad choice can get you into trouble.</p>  <p>Always ask yourself:</p>  <ul>  <li>Are there any loose pieces?</li>  <li>Can I capture these loose pieces?</li>  <li>If I have a choice, which is the best piece for me to capture? And what is the best way to do it?</li>  </ul>  <p><strong>What do you have to do?</strong><br />Take a loose piece and win material. Make sure to choose the best loose piece and the best way of capturing.</p>","assignment":"","stickerID":0,"examples":[{"fen":"b5k1/6pp/p7/4p1b1/8/5NPP/5PK1/2B5 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Yg5][%cal Ra8g2]} 1. Bxg5 1-0","text":"<p>Білі хотіли б взяти слона. Це можна зробити лише одним способом, оскільки кінь зв’язаний.</p>","format":27},{"fen":"3r2k1/1pq2pbp/6p1/p7/P1Npn3/3P4/1P3PPP/3QR1K1 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Ye4][%cal Yc7c4]} 1. Rxe4 (1. dxe4?   Qxc4) 1-0","text":"<p>Зверніть увагу на ворожі фігури. Білий хоче, щоб кінь залишався закритим. Таким чином білі беруть чорного коня з турою.</p>","format":27}],"puzzles":[{"id":41513,"fen":"3r1rk1/pp3ppp/1qnb4/8/5B2/6P1/PPP2PBP/R2Q1R1K w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Rd8][%cal Gf4d6,Rd1d6]} {Q=1} 1. Bxd6 (1. Qxd6? Rxd6 2. Bxd6) 1-0","format":27,"texts":["Захопіть якомога більше очок, забравши більше фігур суперника, ніж втратите."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":41502,"fen":"8/rp1b3R/2pn1k2/p2p1p2/3P1Ppr/8/PP2P1BP/5RK1 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Yh4]} {Q=1} 1. Rxh4 ! (1. Rxd7 Ke6 =) 1-0","format":27,"texts":["Наберіть якомога більше очок."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":41509,"fen":"2q3k1/pprnrppp/3Bpn2/8/2P5/8/PP2QPPP/R2R2K1 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%cal Rc8c7]} {Q=1} 1. Bxe7 +- (1. Bxc7? Qxc7) 1-0","format":27,"texts":["Наберіть якомога